---
import {localeOf} from '../lib/i18n';
const en=localeOf(Astro.url.pathname)==='en';
---
<details class="international-notice"><summary>{en?'Buying from outside France?':'Vous commandez hors de France ?'}</summary><p>{en?'Tempus states that it ships worldwide. Confirm delivery to your address, shipping costs, any import charges and return conditions with the retailer before ordering. The prices on Cadrin are dated euro observations, not currency conversions or delivered quotes.':'Tempus indique livrer dans le monde entier. Confirmez auprès du marchand la livraison à votre adresse, les frais, les éventuels frais d’importation et les conditions de retour. Les prix Cadrin sont des relevés datés en euros, sans conversion ni estimation du prix livré.'}</p><a href="https://tempusshop.com/en/policies/terms-of-sale">{en?'Tempus delivery terms ↗':'Conditions de livraison Tempus ↗'}</a></details>
<style>.international-notice{font-size:.85rem;margin-block:20px;border-block:1px solid var(--line);padding-block:10px}.international-notice summary{cursor:pointer;min-height:44px;align-content:center;font-weight:600}.international-notice p{margin-block:10px}.international-notice a{display:inline-block;min-height:44px;align-content:center}</style>
